    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as a frog mercenary who receives a distress call from a planet called Grodian-F03.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine, build, upgrade and make your universe yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Reputation</strong><br>Establish your dominance in the universe. Become the most feared and respected frog in the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Cave Generation</strong><br>No mission is ever the same. New battles, new bosses, and new ores could be right at your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat</strong><br>Fight against enemies with unique characteristics and abilities depending on the environment.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade with NPCs</strong><br>Sell ores, minerals, and more to earn money, which you can use to expand your space station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buffs and Upgrades</strong><br>Level up your character, enhance your weapons and gear, and unlock abilities to become the galaxy\u2019s most feared mercenary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and become the frog \ud83d\udc38</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as a frog mercenary who receives a distress call from a planet called Grodian-F03.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine, build, upgrade and make your universe yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Reputation</strong><br>Establish your dominance in the universe. Become the most feared and respected frog in the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Cave Generation</strong><br>No mission is ever the same. New battles, new bosses, and new ores could be right at your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat</strong><br>Fight against enemies with unique characteristics and abilities depending on the environment.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade with NPCs</strong><br>Sell ores, minerals, and more to earn money, which you can use to expand your space station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buffs and Upgrades</strong><br>Level up your character, enhance your weapons and gear, and unlock abilities to become the galaxy\u2019s most feared mercenary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and become the frog \ud83d\udc38</strong></p>",
